		{"id":"266d00b6faebca77","type":"text","text":"- Guest 不能配置 Host 只能由 Host 的 VMM 來配置那麼就是使用 kernel mode 或是 user mode 去做防護的這點跟 OS 相同","x":335,"y":893,"width":370,"height":87,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"f62656b89b52932f","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_15_Virtual_Machine/06-三種技術.png","x":880,"y":513,"width":400,"height":247},
		{"id":"dd3981d770d61605","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_15_Virtual_Machine/08-計算機組織_TOPIC_15_Virtual_M.png","x":320,"y":552,"width":400,"height":266},
		{"id":"0d2da7e7198e290e","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_15_Virtual_Machine/07-三種技術.png","x":1360,"y":535,"width":400,"height":203},
		{"id":"47e95c1e9d5e1fc9","type":"text","text":"- 三種技術\n\t1.  time-shared(CPU) 和 partitioned(Memory Disk) 都會使得硬體看起來很多個。\n\t2. emulated 是如果使用 micro programming 的 Control 那麼可以利用裡面的 code 讓她看起來有不同的應題。","x":1159,"y":175,"width":402,"height":184,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"9477fc164f809e44","type":"text","text":"- 成本是 CPU Time 那麼就是 \n- User-level processor-bound programs(CPU-bound) \n\t- 因為沒有使用到 VMM 也就是 IO 硬體設備等等的虛擬化，那麼就是沒有 Overhead。\n\t- I/O-intensive workloads 就是 I/O-bound 那麼這個就會有比較多的虛擬化 Overhead。\n\t- 最後一個在說的就是 CPU 處理的時間可以隱藏掉，因為 I/O-bound","x":1840,"y":530,"width":484,"height":238,"color":"1"}
	],
